# graphify scope for DLNAServer.
# Goal: the server's own source - src/ and tests/, no build output, no vendored
# binaries, no generated code, no media.
#
# The graph is built from the repository root, which is where the CLI and the
# PreToolUse hook-guard look for graphify-out/ by default.

# ===== Build artifacts =====
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/publish/

# ===== Runtime output =====
**/logs/
**/ffmpeg/
media/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.sqlite-shm

# ===== Generated code =====
**/*.Designer.cs
**/*.g.cs
**/*.g.i.cs
**/*.AssemblyInfo.cs
**/*.AssemblyInfoInputs.cache
**/GlobalUsings.g.cs
**/.AssemblyAttributes/
**/*.generated.*

# ===== Static web assets / device icons / thumbnails =====
**/wwwroot/lib/
**/Resources/images/
**/.@__thumb/

# ===== Binary / media =====
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.ico
**/*.svg
**/*.webp
**/*.mp3
**/*.mp4
**/*.mkv
**/*.avi
**/*.pdf
**/*.dll
**/*.exe
**/*.pdb
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
**/*.ttf
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.gz

# ===== Local config noise =====
**/*.csproj.user
**/*.DotSettings.user
**/launchSettings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json

# ===== Meta-instruction files (no architectural value in the graph) =====
**/CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# ===== Our own graphify output =====
graphify-out/
